Successfully deployed five isolated NGINX application workloads (app1 through app5) in the webapp-ns namespace using dynamic NFS storage (nfs-client),
routed via a single Kong Ingress Controller on IP 172.30.7.139 with path-based routing (/app1 through /app5), bound to corporate DNS
(devops-intern-webapp.luluex.com), and secured with mandatory HTTP-to-HTTPS redirect (301) using imported corporate .pem TLS certificates (luluex-tls-secret).

